            "review_text": "Alex T\nKhon Kaen Province, Thailand6 contributions\n0\nLimited options.\nOct 2025 • Friends\nThe foods and matters were ..... basic.\nThe steaks were real small at 250g each - what is termed lady size in W. Europe, Australia etc. The sides were equally small though prices also were on the light side at US$15 per head. \nTried asking if can order larger cut, told no - all pr-butchered off premises. Bit of a shame and leaves looking other restaurant for good sized stakes of 350 to 500g.\n\nThe place is clean, easy parking, staff pleasant - just real small portions keeping prices low! Have a meal before or after you go!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 11, 2025",
