            "review_text": "Son D\n6 contributions\n0\nA Hidden Gem for Western Cuisine in the Heart of Dong Hoi\nApr 2025 • Family\nI visited M-Steakhouse with a group of friends over the weekend, and we were genuinely surprised by how impressive this place is!\n\nThe ambience was the first thing that caught our attention — spacious, modern, and cozy. We especially loved the balcony area overlooking the walking street. It’s the perfect spot to relax, enjoy the evening breeze, and have a great meal.\n\nAs for the food, the steak was perfectly cooked, juicy, and tender — just how we ordered it. We also tried the creamy crab pasta and cheesy beef burger, and they were all delicious and beautifully presented. Plus, they serve craft beer, which pairs wonderfully with the food!\n\nThe staff were friendly and attentive, always ready to assist without being intrusive.\n\nAnd the best part? The price! With just $10–15 per person, you can enjoy a full meal that’s both satisfying and chill. Really great value for money.\n\nIf you’re looking for a solid Western dining experience in Dong Hoi — whether it's a date night, family dinner, or hangout with friends — M-Steakhouse is a must-try!\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2025",
